eared, without elaborating further on current market conditions.   \par \par \uc2 So far financial markets have been sceptical about a possibility of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 But there are growing expectations that the strong zloty's dampening impact on inflation and growth will spur an interest rate cut later this year.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050205e125007ka\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
