\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Poland competitive even with strong zloty-c.banker.   \b0\par\par\uc2 293 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Dezember 2004\par 08:46\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 WARSAW, Dec 2 (Reuters) - Poland's economy is competitive even with the zloty \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's recent strengthening, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Leszek Balcerowicz said on Thursday.   \par \par \uc2 The zloty hit a 20-month high versus the euro on Wednesday, having gained 14 percent against the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  since European Union accession in May. It has also firmed 28 percent against the globally weaker dollar.   \par \par \uc2 "If we look at the economy as a whole, we are competitive even with a stronger zloty. And this is reflected in impressive export performance, " Balcerowicz told public radio.   \par \par \uc2 Polish exports rose 16 percent year-on-year to an all-time high of 6.08 billion euros ($8.08 billion) in September.   \par \par \uc2 "The current zloty exchange rate is close to levels seen in the first quarter of 2003, but productivity has been rising faster since then," he said in an interview.   \par \par \uc2 The zloty's 4.163 high against the euro on Wednesday took it just off the 4.15 level cited by companies as a threshold beyond which exports would become unprofitable.   \par \par \uc2 In a similar survey conducted by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  early in 2004, 4.2 zlotys was seen as the pain threshold, showing the Polish economy's growing ability to cope with appreciation.   \par \par \uc2 Balcerowicz also reiterated the bank's policy of not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. "We are among the countries that conduct a direct inflation target policy, with a floating zloty exchange rate set by markets."   \par \par \uc2 "This strategy has been and is serving Poland well."   \par \par \uc2 This week deputy \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief Krzysztof Rybinski said that \b \highlight22\uc2 forex interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  - not used in \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the zloty's free float in 2000 - were part of a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's toolkit.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041202e0c20050u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
