\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Polish c.bank chief dampens  \highlight22\uc2 fx intervention \highlight\uc2  talk.   \b0\par\par\uc2 403 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Dezember 2004\par 14:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 KATOWICE, \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Dec 1 (Reuters) - Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief Leszek Balcerowicz sought to dampen talk the bank might begin to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb the buoyant zloty, saying the current hands-off policy was right.   \par \par \uc2 "The bank's strategy of not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market has worked well and is working well," Balcerowicz told reporters in the southern Polish city of Katowice.   \par \par \uc2 Balcerowicz was speaking a day after his deputy Krzysztof Rybinski unexpectedly reminded markets that \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  - not used in \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the zloty's free float in 2000 - were part of a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's toolkit.   \par \par \uc2 The topic has surfaced as the Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  touched peaks in recent weeks, triggering concern it could hurt exporters and halt economic growth.   \par \par \uc2 Balcerowicz said the zloty's strengthening against the euro in past months took it back to levels from 2003, adding that Polish firms were better equipped for competition now than then.   \par \par \uc2 "A return to this zloty level versus the euro is happening when our exporters' competitiveness is higher than it was (in 2003)," he said.   \par \par \uc2 His remarks appeared to contradict those of Rybinski, who said the zloty was fundamentally overvalued.   \par \par \uc2 Rybinski, not long ago a market economist, said \b \highlight22\uc2 forex interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  could take place before and during \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's stay in the pre-euro ERM-2 \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime to avoid unwanted \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swings which could hurt the EU newcomers competitiveness.   \par \par \uc2 The zloty has gained 13 percent against the euro since Poland joined the European Union in May. On Wednesday the zloty is a fraction off 20-month highs at 4.18 versus the euro.   \par \par \uc2 Analysts say the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's surprise return to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rhetoric reflects its concern about further strengthening ahead of pegging the zloty to the euro, expected in the coming years.   \par \par \uc2 "The chance of \b \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  used to be zero, but now ... it seems more probable, particularly in the run-up to ERM-2 entry," said Jacek Wisniewski, analyst at Bank Pekao SA.   \par \par \uc2 "Balerowicz appeared to distance himself from Rybiski's comments, but he did not say that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was impossible."   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  hopes to adopt the euro in 2009, which would mean locking the zloty into the managed float of the ERM-2 as soon as 2006. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said the threat of speculative attacks on the zloty was higher during its 2 year ERM-2 stay.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041201e0c10099v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
