\par\par \b \uc2  Polish budget gap may increase in 2003, 2004 - Belka. \b0\par\par\uc2 288 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Januar 2002\par 18:42\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WARSAW, Jan 28 (Reuters) - Polish Finance Minister Marek Belka ruled out a revision of this year's government budget deficit target but said the gap may creep slightly higher in the next two years. Belka's three-month-old leftist administration had to slash spending and introduce revenue-boosting measures to prevent a financing crisis and cap the 2002 budget deficit at 40 billion zlotys ($9.7 billion) or 5.2 percent of gross domestic product. \par \par \uc2  Without austerity measures the deficit was set to balloon to 90 billion zlotys. \par \par \uc2  "We are not expecting a budget revision this year. This budget is crisis-proof," Belka told Reuters in an interview. \par \par \uc2  "I am taking it into account that in the next year or two the deficit could oscillate around this year's level or rise slightly to 42 or 43 billion zlotys," he said. \par \par \uc2  Belka also said that Poland's present free float \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime did not disallow \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the buoyant zloty, which he has tried to talk down for months. \par \par \uc2  "The free float \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime we have does not rule out jaw boning. I tried that and I tried to charm the zloty to fall to 4.25 to the dollar and it just did not work. The free float does not rule out \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which shares responsibility for the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime, says that a free floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  should not be the subject of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Asked if he wanted the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the zloty, he said: "I think we should aim for some depreciation. There are many ways. We can talk, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  or cut rates." \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020128dy1s00y3u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
