\par\par \b \uc2  Balcerowicz - unclear if Czech  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  works. \b0\par\par\uc2 281 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Januar 2002\par 19:34\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  KRAKOW, \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Jan 22 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's national bank Governor Leszek Balcerowicz said on Tuesday it was not clear whether Czech \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the buoyant crown would succeed. \par \par \uc2  The Czech \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (CNB) stepped into the market on Monday to weaken the crown after it rallied sharply, but the unit's subsequent decline was not sustained as buyers returned. \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are not always successful and we will see effects of the Czech \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  after some time passes," Balcerowicz told reporters after receiving an award in the southern city of Krakow. \par \par \uc2  He quickly reiterated the Polish national's bank position against \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, saying: \par \par \uc2  "In the Czech (market) there were huge inflows from privatisation, causing large influx of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . In Poland, the scale of sell-offs is smaller...and the government has a foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  account for privatisation inflows." \par \par \uc2  Analysts say the CNB's move did little to address the fundamental reasons behind crown strength and, while it may dent the crown's rise in the short term, it might also store up problems for later. \par \par \uc2  Earlier this year the zloty reached a 2-1/2 year high against the dollar on the back of portolio inflows seeking to lock in high yields before Poland cuts interest rates. \par \par \uc2  It has fallen slightly in recent days on worries that the Monetary Policy Council may not cut rates at its nearest meeting on January 29-30. \par \par \uc2  Some analysts said that rumours, denied by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , of a coordinated effort by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the government to weaken the zloty have also played a role in the zloty's recent slide. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020122dy1m010ab\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
