ighlight\uc2  market. The reserves shrink whenever the government dips into them to finance foreign debt costs. \par \par \uc2  The IMF also said the government's hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  account, set up to retain off-shore privatisation inflows, should be transaparent and not used to affect the exchange rate levels. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dwcd09y8m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
