\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS - Vague flotation news leave zloty volatile. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Justyna Pawlak \par \uc2 547 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Januar 2000\par 14:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WARSAW, Jan 11 (Reuters) - The Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and finance ministry's decision to withhold details of their talks on the zloty's flotation has left the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  vulnerable to speculation, dealers and analysts said on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Traders have been left to read between the lines, with some betting that a full float of the Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be on the cards shortly, despite the official communique released on Monday afternoon being uninformative. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Leszek Balcerowicz met the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Monetary Policy Council (RPP) for a widely-trailed discussion on the timetable for the full flotation of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Afterwards the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said only that coordination between monetary and fiscal policies had been discussed. \par \par \uc2  "It is a negative for the zloty that no statement had been issued. The market is now acting as if it had some information. The morning rally was caused by that," said Juliet Sampson, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Bank of America in London. \par \par \uc2  "I think I would expect an announcement not in the immediate future but within three months. However, we may not hear about it until the float actually happens," she added. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In the wake of the meeting the zloty\tab   slid to below three percent above parity at Tuesday's open, from a nearly five-month high around 3.5 percent it hit on Monday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par It rebounded later on Tuesday, reaching 3.5 percent stronger than its trading basket centre on the back of foreign demand.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par At 1345 GMT it traded at 3.19 percent above parity. It was at 4.0670 to the dollar and at 4.1775 to the euro.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The zloty's floation, which would include the abolition of its 30-percent trading band, the 0.3 percent per month crawling devaluation and the central parity, now depends on government approval.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  asked the finance ministry for a go ahead last year, but fiscal policy makers have been hesitant for fear that full flotation would make the zloty vulnerable to destabilising speculation or excessive strength.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Last week Finance Ministry advisor Witold Orlowski said the ministry wanted the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to pledge it would \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  against the floated zloty to defend \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Poland\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's fragile export recovery if the unit rose sharply.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par A source close to talks said consensus was reached between the parties but refused to say if the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  had agreed to try to prevent sharp zloty appreciation.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The meeting most likely led to a clearer consensus between the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and the ministry but I don't think a final decision was reached. When it is made the government will most likely announce it," Orlowski said on Tuesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Analysts said the finance ministry might be hesitant to free the zloty in the early days of the year, when it is being driven upwards by heavy portfolio inflows.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "There is a lot of volatility in the zloty now and strong appreciation potential. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  swaps and FRAs (forward rate agreements) market signal that," siad Andrzej Rzysko, treasurer at SG bank in Warsaw.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "So maybe it is too early now," he said. ((Warsaw Newsroom, tel. +48 22 653 9700, fax. +48 22 653 9781, warsaw.newsroom@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 2000.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw1b03pa0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
