\par\par \b \uc2  Polish Zloty Closes Down On Heavy Selling Of Polish Debt \b0\par\par\uc2 296 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Januar 1999\par 16:51\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty (PLZ) closed lower against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket Thursday as investors sold Polish debt following the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sharp cut in interest rates Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The zloty closed 5.75% above the mid-point against its basket, sharply down from around 6.9% at the close of trading Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The zloty is fixed to a basket composed of the dollar and euro and is devalued at a rate of 0.5% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 12.5% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  On Wednesday, the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  cut the 28-day money market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate to 13% from 15%, the Lombard rate to 17% from 20% and the discount rate to 15.5% from 18.25%. Most analysts had expected a rate cut of between 100 and 150 basis points. \par \par \uc2  "After the unexpected big cut in rates, lots of investors closed their debt positions and bought dollars," said Marek Cherubin, dealer at Creditanstalt. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was fixed Thursday at PLZ3.5730, up from the open of about PLZ3.5400 and sharply up Wednesday's fixing of PLZ3.5280. \par \par \uc2  The euro was fixed at PLZ4.1330, sharply up from PLZ4.0960 at 0920 GMT and up from Wednesday's fixing of PLZ4.0840. \par \par \uc2  Cherubin said he doesn't expect the zloty to come under the same selling pressure Friday and said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to stabilize at about 5.5% above the midpoint. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates are between 14.20% and 15.20%, down from 14.60% and 15.30%. \par \par \uc2  -By Jennifer Laidlaw; 48-22 622-2766; jlaidlaw@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 21-01-99 \par \par \uc2  1551GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv1l00ir7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
