\par\par \b \uc2  Poland's zloty regains all Russian crisis losses. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Wojciech Moskwa \par \uc2 548 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 November 1998\par 16:55\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WARSAW, Nov 2 (Reuters) - The Polish zloty climbed back to heights not seen since before Russia's collapse in mid-August, rekindling expectations of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The zloty jumped to 7.28 percent above its trading band centre on Monday from Friday's 6.63 percent - its highest level since August 17 when Russia devalued the rouble. \par \par \uc2  Since the rouble's demise the zloty, which can trade in a band of 12.5 percent on either side of its parity mid-point, touched lows below the central rate and stayed volatile before starting a gradual uptrend some four weeks ago. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the zloty's gains were fuelled by large privatisations that brought capital into the country and by the recent improvement in sentiment on global markets. \par \par \uc2  "External factors that weighed heavy on the zloty seemingly disappeared. Surely (problems in) Brasil and Russia still exist but when things there are calm, the zloty bounces back to pre-crises levels," said Zbigniew Chmielewski, chief dealer at ING Barings in Warsaw. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , worried about the effects of the stronger zloty on Poland's deteriorating current account balance, could start buying dollars on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market if the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  firms much further. \par \par \uc2  "The zloty should quickly return to nine or ten percent above parity unless the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBP) starts to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the meantime," Chmielewski said. \par \par \uc2  "Once the zloty tops eight percent they may start thinking about \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but such actions would only slow, not end, the further appreciation of the zloty," he added. \par \par \uc2  The NBP last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in July. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said Germany's Bayerische HypoVereinsbank's one billion mark aquisition of a 37 percent stake in Poland's Bank Przemyslowo-Handlowy SA (BPH) and the privatisation of telecoms giant TPSA have kept the market under zloty-buying pressure over the last several weeks. \par \par \uc2  But portfolio capital flows were not expected to return as quickly because many investors had been badly burned by the Russian crisis. \par \par \uc2  "FDI and privatisation inflows have pushed the zloty higher with only limited help from porftolio inflows as many foreign players are still licking their wounds after Russia," said Rafal Petsch, senior dealer at Bank of America in Warsaw. \par \par \uc2  Treasury yields also felt the impact of the strengthening zloty and sharp reduction in the Finance Ministry's offer, with the benchmark 52-week T-bill down to 14.12 percent at Monday's auction from 17.15 percent in early September. \par \par \uc2  The Ministry cut this month's T-bill offer by a third from October to only 2.2 billion zlotys over five primary tenders. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said disappointing current account data, which in September alone amounted to about $1.2 billion, could turn sentiment against the zloty if it was sustained. \par \par \uc2  Over the first eight months of the year Poland had a $2.42 billion C/A deficit, or about $300 per month, against a $4.27 billion shortfall in all of 1997 which amounted to 3.2 percent of gross domestic product. \par \par \uc2  ((Warsaw Newsroom, tel. +48 22 653 9700, fax +48 22 653 9780, warsaw.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010926dub205jj7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
