\par\par \b \uc2  Zloty passed test by surviving Russia crisis - RPP. \b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 September 1998\par 20:28\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WARSAW, Sept 9 (Reuters) - The Polish zloty's recent rebound from sharp losses in the wake of the Russian crisis showed the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was strong, said Boguslaw Grabowski, a member of Poland's decision-making Monetary Policy Council. \par \par \uc2  On Wednesday the zloty was fixed around 3.57 percent above its trading band mid-point, up from about even with parity at the height of the crisis in Russia in late August. \par \par \uc2  Before the crisis the zloty traded around 9.0 percent above the parity rate, dangerously near the upper end of its trading band of plus/minus 10 percent from parity. \par \par \uc2  "The zloty passed the test, its depreciation was small looking at the scale of disturbances on world markets," Grabowski told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  "It is important that the process of depreciation stopped and rebounded without any type of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he told Reuters after a Council meeting which cut the country's main market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate by one percent. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's zloty moves within a range of 10 percent above or below a parity rate set each day by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Zloty parity is determined by the value of a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against which the unit is devalued at a rate of 0.50 percent per month. ((Wojciech Moskwa, Warsaw Newsroom, tel. +48 22 653 9700, fax +48 22 653 9780, warsaw.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021108du9900qxp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
