said Adam Farkas, managing director of the National Bank of Hungary. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 26-08-98 \par \par \uc2  1630GMT \par \par \uc2  1193 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8q07aro\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
