\par\par \b \uc2  Polish Monetary Official -4: Sees No More T-Bill Selling \b0\par\par\uc2 254 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 August 1998\par 12:30\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Sales of government securities by foreign investors have pushed the zloty downward against the basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to which it is pegged, Rosati said. But such selling will soon end, he predicted. \par \par \uc2  "Foreign investors who had short-term papers who could sell them at a profit or a small loss have already done so," Rosati. He estimated that foreign investors held about $800 million of Polish Treasury bills and had sold about $200 million to $300 million. \par \par \uc2  Rosati said he didn't see a need for \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , because the zloty remains far from the lower limit of its 20-point trading band. \par \par \uc2  "The bank will definitely \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if (the zloty) reaches the border of the band, that's obvious," he said. \par \par \uc2  However, he added that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  with the sole purpose of "smoothing" volatility on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  "The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if it deems it appropriate with the goal of a certain smoothing" of the zloty, he said. But he added: "The policy of the bank is such that we absolutely won't do anything against the market." \par \par \uc2  The zloty last dipped below the midpoint of its trading band in August 1997, when the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was battered by a devaluation of the koruna in the neighboring Czech Republic and widespread flooding in Poland. \par \par \uc2  By Christopher Wellisz; 48-22 622-2766; cwellisz@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 21-08-98 \par \par \uc2  1030GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8l0754l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
